SUMMARY:Scenic AVL #5: Murdock Grove Weaver Blvd Loop
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\n**Rating**: Moderate\n**Distance**
 : 5.5 miles\n**Pace**: 3.2 mph\n**Elevation Gain**: 800\n**Surface**: Road
 \n**Dogs**: On leash\n**Wildlife**: Wild Turkey\; not likely to see bears.
 \n**Guests:** This is a good hike for guests - there are a couple of spots
  where you can return to the cars if the pace is too fast and/or it's too 
 hot.\n\n**Route**: [Murdock Grove Loop](https://www.alltrails.com/explore/
 map/weaver-grove-park-inner-loop-439d8c9?p=-1&sh=ifwm3x) Note - we will tr
 y to cut over to Lookout Mountain for an extra mile with a view.\n\n**Scen
 ic Asheville Series**: There are 9 [hikes in the series](https://docs.goog
 le.com/spreadsheets/d/1XUm-X1_OhxKIi8JU5rhjsW37cAl4yYx8yB_NEjjI5Lk)\; hike
  them all and receive an attractive badge for your backpack.\n\n**RSVP and
  On-Time Start**:\n\\*If you must cancel\, please change your status to "N
 ot Going" as soon as possible so wait-listers can have sufficient notice.\
 n\n* There are generally 1 or 2 no-shows on my hikes\, so we don't wait fo
 r people to arrive. If you are late\, you'll be left behind.\n\nNotes and 
 comments are genuinely appreciated.\n\n**Disclaimer and Release of Liabili
 ty**:\nThis activity involves hiking on city streets that may have traffic
 . Participants are responsible for their safety on streets and trails. The
  organizer of this trip is a volunteer and not a professional guide. The f
 unction of the organizer is only to organize this trip. If you sign up or 
 participate in this event you acknowledge that you freely and voluntarily 
 agree to assume all risks of injuries\, illnesses\, and damages arising fr
 om\, as a result of\, and associated with this event. In addition\, you ac
 knowledge that you agree to the Meetup terms: [https://www.meetup.com/term
 s](https://www.meetup.com/terms)
